    "group": "Pactbound Zealots",
    "summary": "Record a mark at muster for each Heretic Astartes unit that still needs one. Epic Heroes and units already bearing one of these keywords are exempt. Choose Khorne, Tzeentch, Nurgle, Slaanesh or Chaos Undivided. Psykers cannot receive a Khorne mark. A Character and the unit it joins must share a mark. Transport passengers need the same mark as their Transport, including when they begin embarked.\n\nAfter using Dark Pacts, a marked unit that gains a weapon ability and passes the Leadership test gets its mark benefit for the rest of that phase.\nLethal Hits • A natural 5+ to hit is critical in melee for Khorne and at range for Tzeentch.\nSustained Hits 1 • A natural 5+ to hit is critical at range for Nurgle and in melee for Slaanesh.\nChaos Undivided • Either weapon ability allows the unit’s models to reroll hit rolls of 1.",
